    "updated_at": "2019-09-09T00:36:09Z",
    "body": "@Astrantia Yeah, unfortunately, fonts are not really in my wheelhouse. I usually try to just download one or two massive patched fonts and stick with those.\r\n\r\nFWIW, the upstream for `ttf-twemoji-color` seems to be https://github.com/eosrei/twemoji-color-font#install-on-linux, and they have a few notes on their README as to what works, what's broken, and additional post-install steps you may need to follow.\r\n\r\nAnother approach you may try is somehow trying to hijack the mozilla emoji font file in `/usr/lib/firefox/fonts/TwemojiMozilla.ttf`.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
